ck up [INSERT_LAUNCH_PRODUCT_NAME] before [INSERT_CART_CLOSE_DATE], you also get the Open Rate Diagnostic — a short, specific checklist that tells you exactly which of your current emails is killing your deliverability, and why.\\n\\nNot a general \"email health\" audit. A line-by-line check of the five technical and copy signals that inbox providers use to decide whether your email goes to primary or promotions.\\n\\nThis diagnostic alone is valued at [INSERT_BONUS_VALUE].\\n\\nIt's not listed on the sales page. It doesn't go to everyone — only buyers who come through before the cart closes.\\n\\nHere's why this matters: you can rewrite all four emails perfectly and still land in spam. The diagnostic makes sure the structural work you do this weekend actually gets seen.\\n\\nThe full package — four templates, the audio walkthrough, the subject line swipe file, and the Open Rate Diagnostic — is [INSERT_PRICE].\\n\\nThat's the complete picture. Rewrite the emails. Run the diagnostic. Send with confidence.\\n\\nCart closes [INSERT_CART_CLOSE_DATE] at [INSERT_CART_CLOSE_TIME].\",\n    \"cta\": \"Claim the full package including the Open Rate Diagnostic bonus.\",\n    \"ps\": \"PS — After [INSERT_CART_CLOSE_DATE], the diagnostic goes away. The core product may return. The bonus won't.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"day\": 7,\n    \"subject\": \"Closes tonight\",\n    \"previewText\": \"Cart closes [INSERT_CART_CLOSE_DATE] at [INSERT_CART_CLOSE_TIME]. Here's what disappears with it.\",\n    \"body\": \"The cart for [INSERT_LAUNCH_PRODUCT_NAME] closes [INSERT_CART_CLOSE_DATE] at [INSERT_CART_CLOSE_TIME].\\n\\nAfter that, access to the four templates, the audio walkthrough, the subject line swipe file, and the Open Rate Diagnostic bonus all close with it.\\n\\nHere's what stays the same if you don't act today: your welcome email still sounds like it was written by a form letter. Your abandoned cart sequence still gets ignored. Your re-engagement email still goes unread by the people 