because you lack authority. It went thin because you couldn't locate yourself fast enough to hold the position.\\n\\n[INSERT_LAUNCH_PRODUCT_NAME] is built for exactly this.\\n\\nThe [INSERT_PROGRAMME_DURATION] process gives you a stable internal reference point — something to speak from rather than perform toward.\\n\\nBy week eight, most women in this programme can sit in a room full of demands without automatically reshaping to fit what's required.\\n\\nThat shift is audible. Measurably, observably audible.\\n\\nThe cart is open now. [INSERT_COHORT_LIMIT] places per cohort.\\n\\n[INSERT_HOST_NAME]\",\n    \"cta\": \"Enrol now and secure your place in the current cohort.\",\n    \"ps\": \"PS — The cart closes on [INSERT_CART_CLOSE_DATE] at [INSERT_CART_CLOSE_TIME]. If \"measured\" has followed you through more than one performance review, this cohort is the one to be in.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"day\": 3,\n    \"subject\": \"The real reason you haven't enrolled.\",\n    \"previewText\": \"It's not the price. It's not the timing. Here's what's actually sitting in the way.\",\n    \"body\": \"Let me name what's actually happening.\\n\\nYou've read the emails. Something has landed. But you haven't enrolled — and you're telling yourself it's because you need to think about it.\\n\\nHere's what \"I need to think about it\" usually means at your level:\\n\\nIt means: \"I'm not sure I'm the kind of person who does this sort of thing.\"\\n\\nBecause you've already tried therapy. And the frameworks. And the self-help books that told you to find your why.\\n\\nNone of it solved this — because none of it was designed for this.\\n\\nTherapy is oriented around healing. This isn't a wound — it's an architectural problem. The identity you're performing was built deliberately, piece by piece, in response to real incentives. There is nothing to heal. There is something to reconstruct.\\n\\nFrameworks returned a category. You're already expert at adopting categories. That's not what's missing.\\n\\nWhat's missing is a forensic process applied to your actual biographical material — not a personality type, not a label, not a reflection exercise.\\n\\nIf none of the above has worked, it's not because you didn't try hard enough. It's because you were using the wrong tools.\\n\\n[INSERT_LAUNCH_PRODUCT_NAME] is a different tool entirely.\\n\\nIf after reading this it still doesn't feel like a fit — that's genuinely okay. But if the real reason is hesitation, not mismatch, that's worth sitting with.\\n\\n[INSERT_HOST_NAME]\",\n    \"cta\": \"Enrol now if this is the tool you've been missing.\",\n    \"ps\": \"PS — The guarantee is [INSERT_GUARANTEE_TERMS]. The risk of trying a different tool is lower than you think.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"day\": 5,\n    \"subject\": \"I almost forgot to mention this.\",\n    \"previewText\": \"There's a bonus I haven't told you about yet. Here's what it is — and what it specifically gives you.\",\n    \"body\": \"I should have mentioned this when the cart opened.\\n\\nEveryone who enrols in [INSERT_LAUNCH_PRODUCT_NAME] before [INSERT_CART_CLOSE_DATE] receives an unannounced bonus — valued at [INSERT_BONUS_VALUE].\\n\\nHere's what it is:\\n\\nA private, pre-programme intensive session with [INSERT_HOST_NAME] before the [INSERT_PROGRAMME_DURATION] work begins.\\n\\nThe sole purpose of that session: map the specific rooms and relationships where your voice goes thin under pressure — so week one of the programme isn't spent identifying the problem. It's spent solving it.\\n\\nMost women arrive knowing something is wrong. Fewer can name which exact contexts collapse their authority and why.\\n\\nThis session gives you that map before we start. It compresses the timeline. It means the work we do in the first four weeks is targeted rather than exploratory.\\n\\nValued at [INSERT_BONUS_VALUE]. Included at no extra cost for this cohort only.\\n\\nThe total package — [INSERT_PROGRAMME_DURATION] of 1:1 work, the identity map, the method, plus this intensive — is [INSERT_PRICE].\\n\\nThe cart closes [INSERT_CART_CLOSE_DATE] at [INSERT_CART_CLOSE_TIME].\\n\\nPlaces remaining: [INSERT_COHORT_LIMIT] maximum per cohort.\\n\\nIf this bonus makes the decision clearer, now is the moment.\\n\\n[INSERT_HOST_NAME]\",\n    \"cta\": \"Enrol now to claim the bonus before the cart closes.\",\n    \"ps\": \"PS — This bonus is not available after [INSERT_CART_CLOSE_DATE]. It's specific to this cohort and will not be carried forward.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"day\": 7,\n    \"subject\": \"What closes tonight.\",\n    \"previewText\": \"Cart closes [INSERT_CART_CLOSE_DATE] at [INSERT_CART_CLOSE_TIME]. Here's exactly what you lose access to after that.\",\n    \"body\": \"The cart for [INSERT_LAUNCH_PRODUCT_NAME] closes today — [INSERT_CART_CLOSE_DATE] at [INSERT_CART_CLOSE_TIME].\\n\\nAfter that point, enrolment is closed. The cohort will be full or the window will have passed.\\n\\nHere's what closes with it:\\n\\nThe pre-programme intensive session — valued at [INSERT_BONUS_VALUE] — available to this cohort only.\\n\\nThe current price of [INSERT_PRICE]. Pricing for future cohorts is not confirmed.\\n\\nYour place in a cohort limited to [INSERT_COHORT_LIMIT] women. The next opportunity to enrol is no earlier than [INSERT_COHORT_CLOSE_DATE].\\n\\nThis is the programme for women who've been told they don't fill the room — and are done absorbing that feedback and recalibrating toward something they haven't chosen.\\n\\nThe [INSERT_PROGRAMME_DURATION] process doesn't ask you to perform authority. It helps you locate the voice you already have — the one that was yours before the adapting started.\\n\\nIf you've been waiting for a sign that this is the right moment: the cart closing tonight is the most concrete sign available.\\n\\nEnrol before [INSERT_CART_CLOSE_TIME] today.\\n\\n[INSERT_HOST_NAME]\",\n    \"cta\": \"Enrol now before the cart closes at [INSERT_CART_CLOSE_TIME].\",\n    \"ps\": \"PS — If you have one question standing between you and enrolling, hit reply right now. I'm at my desk and I'll respond before the cart closes.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"day\": 7,\n    \"subject\": \"Last hours. One question answered.\",\n    \"previewText\": \"You've been wondering if this will actually work for someone at your level. Here's the honest answer.\",\n    \"body\": \"You've been wondering something.\\n\\nNot whether the programme sounds right — it does, or you'd have stopped reading these emails days ago.\\n\\nYou've been wondering: \"Will it actually work for someone like me?\"\\n\\nSomeone who's already done the therapy. Already read the books. Already tried the frameworks and found they returned a category she immediately knew how to perform.\\n\\nHere's the honest answer:\\n\\nThis process was built for exactly that woman. Not for someone earlier in her career who is still forming her identity. For someone who has a fully formed, highly functional identity that no longer belongs to her.\\n\\nThe elimination process works because it doesn't ask you to discover who you are. It asks you to notice who you aren't — and it does that systematically, across the actual contexts of your actual life, over [INSERT_PROGRAMME_DURATION].\\n\\nThat's a different question. And it's one you haven't been asked before.\\n\\nThis is the last email about [INSERT_LAUNCH_PRODUCT_NAME].\\n\\nThe cart closes at [INSERT_CART_CLOSE_TIME] today.\\n\\nIf you enrol: you start the process of speaking from a stable self rather than performing toward one.\\n\\nIf you don't: the next performance review will use the same word. And you'll absorb it again.\\n\\nThe choice is yours. But the window closes at [INSERT_CART_CLOSE_TIME].\\n\\n[INSERT_HOST_NAME]\",\n    \"cta\": \"Enrol now — the cart closes at [INSERT_CART_CLOSE_TIME] today.\",\n    \"ps\": \"PS — This is genuinely the last email. The cart closes at [INSERT_CART_CLOSE_TIME] and I won't be reopening it. If you're in, now is the moment.\"\n  }\n]"}
